OL,3,GNEWSAReform Senedd motion declaring
OL,4,AWales should stay in UK voted down
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers instead passed a revised motion
OL,7,Fincorporating an amendment proposed by
OL,8,FPlaid Cymru, stating "the people of
OL,9,FWales should decide Wales'
OL,10,Fconstitutional future".
